msgstr "全屏音乐播放器打开前的闲置时长（默认：1 分钟）[CR]可用选项：10 秒、15 秒、20 秒、30 秒、1 分钟"

msgctxt "#31318"
msgid "The music player information is normally controlled by the info button (default Kodi behaviour). This option prevents this and always shows the music player information."
msgstr "音乐播放器信息通常由信息按钮控制（Kodi 默认行为）。该选项可避免这种情况，并始终显示音乐播放器信息。"

msgctxt "#31319"
msgid "Orange"
msgstr "橙色"

msgctxt "#31320"
msgid "Settings to change the look of the weather window and the weather main menu widget"
msgstr "更改天气窗口和天气主菜单部件外观的设置"

