msgstr "在天气窗口和天气小部件中显示每日天气预报图标"

msgctxt "#31322"
msgid "Background weather fanart shown when highlighting the weather widget's daily forecast[CR]Multi-image weather fanart is not supported!"
msgstr "高亮显示天气小部件的每日预报时显示背景天气扇形图[CR]不支持多图像天气扇形图！"

