msgid "Disable the underline texture used for highlighting focused elements"
msgstr "禁用用于突出显示焦点元素的下划线纹理"

msgctxt "#31325"
msgid "Amount of dimming of non-focused images such as cover art in library views and widgets (default: 100%)[CR]Options available: 0%, 33%, 66%, 100%, 133%"
msgstr "非聚焦图像的调光量，如库视图和小部件中的封面艺术（默认：100%）[CR]选项可用: 0%, 33%, 66%, 100%, 133%"

msgctxt "#31326"
msgid "Font size of plot and description texts in wall and list info views as well as OSD info dialogs (default: S)[CR]Options available: S, M, L, XL"
msgstr "显示墙和列表信息视图以及 OSD 信息对话框中绘图和说明文本的字体大小（默认值：S）[CR]可用选项：S、M、L、XL"

msgctxt "#31327"
msgid "Hide the watched indicator shown on video fanart in wall views, wide views and widgets and in front of list view elements"
msgstr "在墙视图、宽视图、部件和列表视图元素前隐藏视频扇形图上显示的 \"已观看 \"指示器"

msgctxt "#31328"
msgid "Hide the listened to indicator shown on music fanart in wall views, wide views and widgets and in front of list view elements"
msgstr "在墙视图、宽视图、部件和列表视图元素前隐藏音乐扇形图上显示的已听指示器"

msgctxt "#31329"
msgid "The info dialogs can either show details next to the cover/icon art or a description/plot text. The second page is accessible via a button in the info dialogs and it contains additional information not shown on the first page like either a description/plot text or details information. (default: Details)"
msgstr "信息对话框既可以显示封面/图标旁边的详细信息，也可以显示说明/剧情文本。第二页可通过信息对话框中的按钮访问，其中包含第一页未显示的附加信息，如描述/情节文本或详细信息。(默认：详细信息）"

msgctxt "#31330"
msgid "Enables the option to set user ratings for library items (video and music) via the info dialogs and shows user ratings in library views."
msgstr "启用此选项后，可通过信息对话框为库项目（视频和音乐）设置用户评级，并在库视图中显示用户评级。"

msgctxt "#31331"
msgid "Changes the format used to show the duration of scraped videos except music videos (default: Minutes)[CR]Options available: Minutes (e.g. 128 min, 20 min, 45 sec), Hours and minutes (e.g. 2hr 8min, 20 min, 45 sec)"
msgstr "更改用于显示除音乐视频以外的抓取视频时长的格式（默认：分钟）[CR]可用选项：分钟（例如 128 分钟、20 分钟、45 秒）、小时和分钟（例如 2 小时 8 分钟、20 分钟、45 秒）"

msgctxt "#31332"
msgid "Set which information is shown in video media flags in the bottom left corner (default: File first)[CR]The information will cycle between file and language information during idle every 5 seconds, if 'File first' or 'Language first' is set. Options available: File first/only (video and audio codec information), Language first/only (audio and subtitle language information), Duration only (only the duration and file size are shown), Disabled (media flags are hidden)"
msgstr "设置在左下角的视频媒体标志中显示哪些信息（默认：文件优先）[CR]如果设置了\"文件优先\"或\"语言优先\"，则每5秒在空闲期间，信息将在文件和语言信息之间循环。 可用选项：文件优先/仅（视频和音频编解码器信息），语言优先/仅（音频和字幕语言信息），仅持续时间（仅显示持续时间和文件大小），禁用（媒体标志隐藏）"

msgctxt "#31333"
msgid "Hide the first letter label shown left of window titles when scrolling alphabetically sorted lists.[CR]Alphabetical sort orders supported:"
msgstr "在滚动按字母顺序排序的列表时，隐藏窗口标题左侧显示的第一个字母标签："

msgctxt "#31334"
msgid "Hide player controls shown in sidemenus (not context menus) during background video or music playback"
msgstr "在播放背景视频或音乐时，隐藏侧边菜单（而非上下文菜单）中显示的播放器控件"

msgctxt "#31335"
msgid "Show a lock icon instead of the channel icon for channels reported as encrypted"
msgstr "显示报告为加密的频道的锁定图标而不是频道图标"

msgctxt "#31336"
msgid "Hide scrollbars in all views where a list or panel has more than one page"
msgstr "在列表或面板具有多个页面的所有视图中隐藏滚动条"

msgctxt "#31337"
msgid "In kiosk mode the sidemenu for adjusting views, sort order, filters, etc. can't be opened. Also, the info dialogs don't show any buttons to re-scrape library items or manipulate fanart."
msgstr "在 kiosk 模式下，无法打开用于调整视图、排序顺序、过滤器等的侧边菜单。此外，信息对话框也没有显示任何按钮来重新抓取库中的项目或操作扇形图。"

msgctxt "#31338"
msgid "Settings of and information about add-ons supported by the skin"
msgstr "皮肤支持的附加组件的设置和相关信息"

msgctxt "#31339"
msgid "Enables customization of the main menu[CR]If not installed or disabled, the main menu will fall back to the default configuration."
msgstr "启用自定义主菜单[CR]如果未安装或禁用，主菜单将回退到默认配置。"

msgctxt "#31340"
msgid "Warning: This add-on is currently only available from 'Marcelveldt's BETA repository' which has to be installed manually.[CR][CR]Additional customization functions[CR]Required for the following two add-ons"
msgstr "警告：此附加组件目前只能从 \"Marcelveldt 的 BETA 版本库 \"中获取，必须手动安装。[CR][CR]附加自定义功能[CR]以下两个附加组件需要的功能"

