msgctxt "#31351"
msgid "Debug labels providing information about the currently shown windows and dialogs as well as currently focused controls"
msgstr "调试标签提供有关当前显示的窗口和对话框以及当前聚焦控件的信息"

msgctxt "#31352"
msgid "Reload the skin's files after performing skin code changes"
msgstr "修改皮肤代码后重新加载文件"

msgctxt "#31353"
msgid "The order of the items can be changed by using the up and down arrows next to the list items. Red coloured items are disabled and not visible in the main menu."
msgstr "可以使用列表项旁边的向上和向下箭头来更改项目的顺序。红色项目被禁用，在主菜单中不可见。"

msgctxt "#31354"
msgid "Opens a selection dialog to choose the action the main menu item performs"
msgstr "打开选择对话框以选择主菜单项执行的操作"

msgctxt "#31355"
msgid "Changes the title of an existing main menu item"
msgstr "更改现有主菜单项标题"

msgctxt "#31356"
msgid "Opens a selection dialog to change the action the existing main menu item performs"
msgstr "打开选择对话框以更改现有主菜单项执行的操作"

msgctxt "#31357"
msgid "Sets a single image or multi-image background for the selected main menu item"
msgstr "为选定的主菜单项设置单张图像或多张图像背景"

msgctxt "#31358"
msgid "Sets the time for which each background image is shown (default: 30s)"
msgstr "设置显示每个背景图像的时间（默认值：30s）"

msgctxt "#31359"
msgid "Opens the customization dialog for submenu items of the selected main menu item"
msgstr "打开所选主菜单项的子菜单项的自定义对话框"

msgctxt "#31360"
msgid "Opens the customization dialog for widgets of the selected main menu item"
msgstr "打开所选主菜单项的小部件的自定义对话框"

msgctxt "#31361"
msgid "Hides the selected main menu item in the main menu without deleting it in this customization dialog"
msgstr "在主菜单中隐藏选中的主菜单项，而不在此自定义对话框中删除它"

msgctxt "#31362"
msgid "Deletes the selected main menu item completely. Warning: This can be reverted only for default main menu items!"
msgstr "完全删除选定的主菜单项。警告：这只能针对默认的主菜单项进行还原！"

msgctxt "#31363"
msgid "Opens a selection dialog to choose the action the submenu item performs"
msgstr "打开选择对话框以选择子菜单项执行的操作"

msgctxt "#31364"
msgid "Changes the title of an existing submenu item"
msgstr "更改现有子菜单项标题"

msgctxt "#31365"
msgid "Opens a selection dialog to change the action the existing submenu item performs"
msgstr "打开选择对话框以更改现有子菜单项执行的作"

msgctxt "#31366"
msgid "Hides the selected submenu item in the main menu without deleting it in this customization dialog"
msgstr "在主菜单中隐藏选定的子菜单项，而不在此自定义对话框中将其删除"

msgctxt "#31367"
msgid "Deletes the selected submenu item completely. Warning: This can be reverted only for default submenu items!"
msgstr "完全删除选定的子菜单项。警告： 这只能对默认子菜单项进行还原！"

msgctxt "#31368"
msgid "Opens a selection dialog to choose where a widget should point to"
msgstr "打开一个选择对话框，选择小部件应指向的位置"

msgctxt "#31369"
msgid "Changes the title of an existing widget"
msgstr "更改现有小部件标题"

msgctxt "#31370"
msgid "Changes the appearance of the widget. Options available: Tall (2:3 aspect ratio, suitable for portrait icons like movie or TV show cover art), Wide (3:4 aspect ratio, suitable for landscape icons like episode cover art), Square and Square small (3:3/2:2 aspect ratio, suitable for square icons like album fanart or PVR channel icons)"
msgstr "更改小部件的外观。 可供选择：高（2：3宽高比，适用于电影或电视节目封面等肖像图标），宽（3：4宽高比，适用于风景图标，如插曲封面），方形和方形小（3：3/2：2宽高比，适用于相册fanart或PVR频道图标等方形图标）"

msgctxt "#31371"
msgid "Changes the artwork used for the widget items. Available options depend on the widget content."
msgstr "更改用于小部件项的艺术作品。 可用选项取决于小组件内容。"

msgctxt "#31372"
msgid "Changes the fallback artwork used for the widget items. Available options depend on the widget content."
msgstr "更改用于小部件项的回退艺术作品。 可用选项取决于小组件内容。"

msgctxt "#31373"
msgid "Changes the sort key of the widget items. Available options depend on the widget content."
msgstr "更改小组件项的排序键。 可用选项取决于小组件内容。"

msgctxt "#31374"
msgid "Changes the sort order of the widget items. Available options depend on the widget content."
msgstr "更改小组件项目的排序顺序。可用选项取决于小组件内容。"

msgctxt "#31375"
msgid "Changes the maximum number of items shown by the widget. Options available: 10, 15, 20, 25, 30, 50, 100, None (all items available)"
msgstr "更改小组件显示的最大项数。 可供选择: 10, 15, 20, 25, 30, 50, 100, 无(所有可用项目)"

msgctxt "#31376"
msgid "Hides the selected widget in the main menu without deleting it in this customization dialog"
msgstr "在主菜单中隐藏选中的小部件，而不在此自定义对话框中删除该小部件"

msgctxt "#31377"
msgid "Deletes the selected widget completely. Warning: This can be reverted only for default widgets!"
msgstr "完全删除选定的小部件。 警告:这只能恢复为默认的小部件!"

msgctxt "#31378"
msgid "Add a custom main menu item to the left list"
msgstr "将自定义主菜单项添加到左侧列表"

msgctxt "#31379"
msgid "Add a custom submenu menu item to the left list"
msgstr "将自定义子菜单项添加到左侧列表"

msgctxt "#31380"
msgid "Add a custom widget to the left list"
msgstr "将自定义小组件添加到左侧列表"

msgctxt "#31381"
msgid "Restore default main menu items previously deleted"
msgstr "恢复以前删除的默认主菜单项"

msgctxt "#31382"
msgid "Restore default submenu items previously deleted"
msgstr "恢复以前删除的默认子菜单项"

msgctxt "#31383"
msgid "Restore default widgets previously deleted"
msgstr "恢复以前删除的默认小部件"

msgctxt "#31384"
msgid "The left list shows the items visible in the main menu."
msgstr "左侧列表显示主菜单中可见的项目。"

msgctxt "#31385"
msgid "The right list offers options specific to the main menu item selected in the left list."
msgstr "右侧列表提供特定于左侧列表中选择的主菜单项的选项。"

msgctxt "#31386"
msgid "The left list shows the items visible in the submenu of the main menu item selected in the previous dialog."
msgstr "左侧列表显示在上一个对话框中选择的主菜单项的子菜单中可见的项目。"

msgctxt "#31387"
msgid "The right list offers options specific to the submenu item selected in the left list."
msgstr "右侧列表提供特定于左侧列表中所选子菜单项的选项。"

msgctxt "#31388"
msgid "The left list shows the widgets visible next to the main menu item selected in the previous dialog. There's only one widget visible in the main menu per main menu item at the time. To toggle between more than one widget configured for a main menu item, select the widget in the main menu and use the arrow up and down buttons on your remote."
msgstr "左侧列表显示在上一个对话框中选择的主菜单项旁边可见的小部件。此时，每个主菜单项的主菜单中只有一个小组件可见。要在为主菜单项配置的多个小组件之间切换，请在主菜单中选择该小组件，然后使用遥控器上的向上和向下箭头按钮。"

msgctxt "#31389"
msgid "The right list offers options specific to the widget selected in the left list."
msgstr "右侧列表提供特定于左侧列表中选择的小部件的选项。"

msgctxt "#31390"
msgid "Disable item count"
msgstr "禁用项目计数"

msgctxt "#31391"
msgid "Hide the item count in the bottom right corner"
msgstr "隐藏右下角的项目计数"

msgctxt "#31392"
msgid "Wide low info"
msgstr "宽版紧凑信息"

msgctxt "#31393"
msgid "Notification for a subsequent episode during TV show playback"
msgstr "电视节目播放期间后续剧集的通知"

msgctxt "#31394"
msgid "Are you sure you want to reset all skin settings to default?"
msgstr "确定要重置所有皮肤设置为默认值吗？"

msgctxt "#31395"
msgid "Square"
msgstr "方形"

msgctxt "#31396"
msgid "Square small"
msgstr "小方形"

msgctxt "#31397"
msgid "Main menu item"
msgstr "主菜单项"

msgctxt "#31398"
msgid "Submenu item"
msgstr "子菜单项"

msgctxt "#31399"
msgid "Reset all main menu items"
msgstr "重置所有主菜单项"

msgctxt "#31400"
msgid "Edit library nodes"
msgstr "编辑媒体库节点"

msgctxt "#31401"
msgid "Automatic masking during playback"
msgstr "播放时自动遮罩"

msgctxt "#31402"
msgid "The masking aspect ratio will be determined based on a file name tag (e.g. '.AR240.') being present or not. After playback has stopped, masking will revert to the above set aspect ratio. If no tag is present, masking will rely on the above set aspect ratio.[CR]Supported file name tags: AR178, AR200, AR233, AR235, AR240 (surrounded by any combination of these characters: - . _ )"
msgstr "屏蔽的宽高比将根据是否存在文件名标记（如\".AR240.\"）来确定。播放停止后，屏蔽将恢复到上述设定的宽高比。如果没有标签，屏蔽将依赖于上述设置的宽高比：AR178、AR200、AR233、AR235、AR240（由以下任意字符组合包围： - . _ )"

msgctxt "#31403"
msgid "Cinemascope masking"
msgstr "宽银幕遮罩"

msgctxt "#31404"
msgid "Repository"
msgstr "存储库"

msgctxt "#31405"
msgid "Enter colour value"
msgstr "输入颜色值"

msgctxt "#31406"
msgid "Library Node Editor"
msgstr "媒体库节点编辑器"

msgctxt "#31407"
msgid "Reset to colour default"
msgstr "重置为默认颜色"

msgctxt "#31408"
msgid "Enables customization of library nodes from the library root context menu"
msgstr "启用从媒体库根上下文菜单自定义库节点"

msgctxt "#31409"
msgid "Set default view for video add-ons"
msgstr "设置视频插件的默认视图"

msgctxt "#31410"
msgid "Default view"
msgstr "默认视图"

msgctxt "#31411"
msgid "Views in video add-ons have to be set for each page seperately. Force a specific view to be used for all video add-on pages."
msgstr "视频插件中的视图必须为每个页面单独设置。强制将特定视图用于所有视频加载项页面。"

msgctxt "#31412"
msgid "Set the view used for all video add-on pages (default: List)[CR]Options available: List, List info, Wide, Wide low, Wide low info, Wall, Wall info, Wall small, Wall small info, Wall low"
msgstr "设置所有视频附加组件页面使用的视图（默认：列表）[CR]可用选项：列表、列表信息、宽版、宽版紧凑、宽版信息、墙、信息墙、小墙、小信息墙、紧凑墙"

