msgid "Disable the genre based colour background of the TV/radio guide tiles for a more minimalistic look."
msgstr "禁用电视/广播指南节目块的类型颜色背景，获得极简风格界面。"

msgctxt "#31434"
msgid "Pick colour"
msgstr "选择颜色"

msgctxt "#31435"
msgid "Colour used for menu and OSD backgrounds[CR]Adjust colour opacity via the edit colour value button (the alpha channel - the first two hex digits adjust opacity)"
msgstr "用于菜单和 OSD 背景的颜色[CR]通过编辑颜色值按钮调整颜色的不透明度（alpha 通道--前两位十六进制数字调整不透明度）。"

msgctxt "#31436"
msgid "Disable two-shaded background colour overlay"
msgstr "禁用双阴影背景颜色叠加"

msgctxt "#31437"
msgid "Replace the default two-shaded background colour overlay by a plain colour style for the background overlay of windows and dialogs."
msgstr "将默认的双阴影背景颜色叠加层替换为窗口和对话框的背景叠加层的纯色样式。"

msgctxt "#31438"
msgid "Default select action for album widgets"
msgstr "专辑小部件的默认选择操作"

msgctxt "#31439"
msgid "Default select action for TV show widgets"
msgstr "电视节目小部件的默认选择操作"

msgctxt "#31440"
